id:                     E2204
severity:               2
category:               platform, build-system, linking
trigger_tool: cmake|conan|clang
phase: configuration|compilation|linking
error_signature: eathread/.*\.h' file not found|EABase/eabase\.h' file not found|EAAssert/eaassert\.h'
  file not found|include could not find requested file: CommonCppFlags|undefined symbol: operator
  new\[\]\(unsigned long, char const\*, int, unsigned int, char const\*, int\)
match_keywords: eathread, eabase, eaassert, eastdc, EA 家族, plain-name, CommonCppFlags, operator new

root_cause: EA 家族库间按头文件链式互 include 设计（public 头无条件 include 兄弟库头，
  与功能宏取值无关），且上游 CMake 用 plain-name 声明依赖、不生成/传播 CMake target，
  纯净源码树（无测试子模块）编译与消费者链接时出现头文件/符号不可见问题

rec_approach: 见 approach 字段四要点；依赖发布链按 R36（eabase 已发布 → eaassert/eathread 待发布）

